# launches, and trimming it would trim the tail this sweep measures.
#
# WHAT THIS LOG IS FOR. It is the validation run for the launch protocol in
# scripts/run_launches.sh and scripts/aggregate_launches.py -- a SECOND,
# independent thirty-launch sweep of the row that was first done by hand, so
# that the protocol's own claim can be checked instead of taken.
